            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nAlthough I understand the appeal, I don't think it is a good idea in the long term to support this. Apart from the usual \"added complexity to both implementation and config\", having text appear in *exactly* the same way as it is used in built-in help (i.e. `:h key-notation`) should be beneficial.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
